    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of a triangle ship thing that really does not like colors in this top-down arcade shooter with rougelite elements and kill procedurally-animated color enemies to unlock upgrades to kill more colors </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928990/extras/794ce11bcf511bc850a676a1e5ad3e1a.poster.avif?t=1753117520\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928990/extras/794ce11bcf511bc850a676a1e5ad3e1a.webm?t=1753117520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928990/extras/794ce11bcf511bc850a676a1e5ad3e1a.mp4?t=1753117520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Kill Colors</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight enemies with rapidly changing colors and procedural animations to increase your score and to progress the waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect Upgrades</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each wave of colors, collect upgrades to increase your stats or unlock new abilities to allow for even more killing of colors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get a Highscore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from three difficulties and compete for a spot at the top of each respective leaderboard.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of a triangle ship thing that really does not like colors in this top-down arcade shooter with rougelite elements and kill procedurally-animated color enemies to unlock upgrades to kill more colors </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928990/extras/794ce11bcf511bc850a676a1e5ad3e1a.poster.avif?t=1753117520\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928990/extras/794ce11bcf511bc850a676a1e5ad3e1a.webm?t=1753117520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928990/extras/794ce11bcf511bc850a676a1e5ad3e1a.mp4?t=1753117520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Kill Colors</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight enemies with rapidly changing colors and procedural animations to increase your score and to progress the waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect Upgrades</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each wave of colors, collect upgrades to increase your stats or unlock new abilities to allow for even more killing of colors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get a Highscore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from three difficulties and compete for a spot at the top of each respective leaderboard.</p>",
